<p>The <strong class="selflink">ABI_base.xls</strong> file contains the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2DA" title="2da">2da</a> files that define and integrate all skills, spells, talents and item abilities in the game.
</p><p>The workbook contains the following worksheets:
</p>
<ul><li> <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/ABI%202da" title="ABI 2da">ABI_Base</a></li>
<li> <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Ability%20data%202da" title="Ability data 2da">ability_data</a></li>
<li> <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Ability%20effects%202da" title="Ability effects 2da">ability_effects</a></li>
<li> <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Passive%20abilities%202da" title="Passive abilities 2da">passive_abilities</a></li>
<li> _tooltip_strings</li>
<li> _damage_strings</li></ul>
